# Use /* (not /) so the directory stays in git's view — otherwise the
# `!data/melodies/<demo_hash>.json` re-include rules below have no effect
# (git can't re-include a child once the parent dir is excluded).
data/melodies/*
# Demo-song melody files — 15 specific hashes shipped with the repo so demos
